# Moddy Arena: the prep phase and a battle's wishes. In prep, an Apprentice make from the prep room lands in the arena
# ahead of him; an Apprentice item (a Fire Sword, a Builder make) is put
# on his hotbar from its own page in My wishes (his watch, then the page's "Add to hotbar" tile), and shows there with
# the Moddy badge. In the battle the hotbar makes it again with one click, a second click at once is refused with the
# seconds left, and a new make is refused with the arena's words. He wins the battle with that sword. After the battle
# the wish is still on his hotbar and new makes work again. No model anywhere: the Apprentice's local matcher offers
# the makes, and the hotbar replays the kept make's recipe.
# A resistance effect keeps him on his feet (setup: a safety guard); every monster is beaten by his own hits: he turns
# to it, walks toward it, and clicks the mouse (a click out of reach swings at the air, as it does for a player).
# play-timeout: 1500
@intent in prep a player makes a thing from the prep room into the arena and puts one of his makes on his hotbar from its page; in a battle the hotbar fires it, it rests between fires, and new wishes are refused; after the battle the hotbar wish is still there
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@expect chat press Add to hotbar within 10s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true

@step what the arena says about wishes in prep
moddy wishes
@expect chat Magician wishes left before the next battle: 3 of 3 within 5s
@expect chat Builder and Apprentice wishes are free within 5s

@step a make from the prep room lands in the arena ahead of him
# the core's Builder puts a make 12 blocks ahead of him: from the middle of the prep room, where he arrives, facing
# the arena, that is through the gate on the arena's floor
@aim look 180 12
@wait 2s
moddy apprentice a stone well
@expect screen Container within 10s
@shot prep-room-apprentice-page
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
# the arena ahead of the gate is no longer empty air (compared with the empty sky at y 200): the well stands in it
@assert execute unless blocks -4 64 3 4 67 15 -4 200 3 all
@shot made-from-the-prep-room

@step an Apprentice sword in the prep room
moddy apprentice a fire sword
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 3/ within 60s
@wait 3s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.2 *
@shot the-sword

@step into the arena
# he opens the gate in the shared wall and walks through it, into the arena, up to the well he made (a couple of steps
# first, empty-handed, so the gate is in reach and the click is not his watch's). A make in the arena itself is
# 2-wish-in-the-arena's and 7-creature-in-the-arena's: here the arena keeps one small make, so the battle stays fair.
@key key.hotbar.9
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 8t
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 35t
@wait 10t
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=30]
@shot in-the-arena

@step the Fire Sword goes on his hotbar from its page
# his watch, My wishes, the Fire Sword (one of his makes: its page opens), "Add to hotbar": the core puts its hotbar
# wish in the first empty slot (slot 4: the watch, the Wish Bag and the sword are in the first three)
@key key.hotbar.1
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "My wishes"
@expect screen My wishes within 10s
@shot my-wishes
@click item "Fire Sword"
@expect screen Fire Sword within 10s
@wait 1s
@shot its-page
@click item "Add to hotbar"
@expect chat On your hotbar, slot 4 within 10s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
# the Moddy badge: the hotbar wish wears Moddy's own hotbar model
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper[minecraft:item_model="wishpack:hotbar"]
# every screen closed (the page, and the watch it came from)
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s
# the sword he made is put away into his inventory (a shift-click), so the one the hotbar makes in the battle is
# plainly a new one
@key key.inventory
@expect screen InventoryScreen within 3s
@click slot 38 shift
@key key.inventory
@assert execute unless items entity @s hotbar.2 *
@wait 1s
@shot on-the-hotbar

@step he starts a battle with the button
# back through the gate into the prep room, then the start button on the control panel
@aim look 0 0
@key key.forward hold 40t
@wait 10t
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8]
# empty-handed, he walks up to the start button on the board, then presses it
@key key.hotbar.9
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.forward hold 40t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
moddy wishes
@expect chat fire your wishes from your hotbar within 5s

@step wave 1, and the hotbar makes the sword again
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@aim look 180 30
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
@key key.hotbar.4
@wait 5t
@assert execute if items entity @s weapon.mainhand minecraft:paper
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 3/ within 60s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.2 *
@shot fired-from-the-hotbar

@step at once again: it rests, and says how long
# past the core's own one-second sweep, well inside the arena's ten-second rest
@wait 2s
@key key.use
@expect actionbar /That wish is resting. It is ready again in [0-9]+ seconds?/ within 5s
@shot resting

@step a new make in the battle is refused
moddy apprentice a cozy house
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat only the wishes on your hotbar work now within 10s
@wait 2s
@shot new-wish-refused

@step he wins the battle with the sword his hotbar made
# through the gate he left open, into the arena
@key key.hotbar.3
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 30t
@repeat each @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] max 60 until execute unless entity {it}
@aim entity {it}
@key key.forward hold 6t
@aim entity {it}
@key key.mouse.left
@wait 12t
@end-repeat
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat each @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] max 60 until execute unless entity {it}
@aim entity {it}
@key key.forward hold 6t
@aim entity {it}
@key key.mouse.left
@wait 12t
@end-repeat
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat each @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] max 60 until execute unless entity {it}
@aim entity {it}
@key key.forward hold 6t
@aim entity {it}
@key key.mouse.left
@wait 12t
@end-repeat
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat each @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] max 60 until execute unless entity {it}
@aim entity {it}
@key key.forward hold 6t
@aim entity {it}
@key key.mouse.left
@wait 12t
@end-repeat
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat each @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] max 60 until execute unless entity {it}
@aim entity {it}
@key key.forward hold 6t
@aim entity {it}
@key key.mouse.left
@wait 12t
@end-repeat
@expect chat You won the battle within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s

@step after the battle the hotbar wish is still there, and new makes work again
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
moddy wishes
@expect chat Magician wishes left before the next battle: 3 of 3 within 5s
@aim look 180 12
@wait 2s
moddy apprentice a cozy house
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 2s
@shot after-the-battle
